+# Installing and testing the parameter-estimation additions
+
+IF2 supports vector-valued bootstrap states and model factories. StopGradientDPF accepts an optional alpha; its default remains one. The optimizer is external.
+
+From this repository root, in a Python environment compatible with its package metadata:
+
+```sh
+python -m pip install ./pydpf
+python -m pip install pytest
+python examples/if2_and_discount.py
+python -m pytest tests
+```
+
+The example uses a small model and runs on CPU. It does not require Dacca data or a neighboring repository. Tests retain independent particle recursions and small upstream regression data with recorded source and dependency versions. GPU execution and the full upstream CI matrix are separate checks.
